  "name": "Making Tax Digital: Does It Apply to Me? — 1234Tools",
  "short_name": "Making Tax Digital:",
  "description": "Work out whether Making Tax Digital for Income Tax catches you, and from which April. It adds up your qualifying income the way HMRC defines it - gross income before expenses, across every trade and every property business - shows the sum, names the threshold that catches you, counts your quarterly updates, and gives you the first period and its deadline. Guidance as at 2026-09-20; gov.uk is the authority. Runs in your browser.",
